    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5395" root="جر" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِرِّيَّةٌ</span></b>  The <i>stomach,</i> or <i>triple stomach,</i> or the
<i>crop,</i> or <i>craw,</i> of a bird; syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوْصَلَةٌ</span>; (S, K;)
as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِرِّيْئَةٌ</span> [q. v.] (K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِرِّيَّةٌ</span>. (AZ, TA.)
You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ألْقَاهُ فِى جِرِّيَّتِهِ</span>, meaning, (tropical:)  <i>He ate it.</i>
(A, TA.) See also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جرى</span>.

